# Security hardening headers for the docs site (Cloudflare Pages).
# Applied to every response. 'unsafe-inline' is kept only because Starlight
# injects inline theme styles/scripts. 'wasm-unsafe-eval' permits WebAssembly
# compilation ONLY (never JS eval/new Function) — Pagefind's search index is a
# WASM module, so without it every search on the site throws CompileError and
# hangs at "Searching…". Google Fonts is allowlisted because Starlight loads
# its UI fonts AND the Material Symbols icon font from there: the stylesheet
# comes from fonts.googleapis.com (style-src) and the font files from
# fonts.gstatic.com (font-src) — both must be permitted or the icon font
# silently disappears. Cloudflare Web Analytics needs two origins: the beacon
# script loads from static.cloudflareinsights.com (script-src) and reports
# page views to cloudflareinsights.com (connect-src) — without them the
# CF-Pages-injected beacon is silently blocked and analytics record nothing.
# Inventory any new third-party origin before adding it.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=(), interest-cohort=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'
